<title>PAKISTAN: Pakistan gold prices seen mixed before budget.</title>
<headline>Pakistan gold prices seen mixed before budget.</headline>
<dateline>KARACHI, Pakistan 1997-06-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pakistan gold prices are likely to remain mixed before the June 13 announcement of the 1997/98 (July-June) budget, while silver prices were seen steady amid low demand, dealers said on Monday.</p>
<p>Gold prices fluctuated last week in pre-budget speculative buying, a dealer at the Karachi bullion market said.</p>
<p>Following are the weekly prices:</p>
<p>							 Saturday   June 2</p>
<p>    Gold 24 carat in rupees per 10 grams   4,685	4,750</p>
<p>    Silver per 1,000 grammes		   6,600	6,600</p>
<p>($1 = 40.49 rupees) -- Ibrahim Khan 9221-5685192</p>
</text>
